.TH DENIALD 1 "August 2026" "Denial" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
deniald \- run the Denial Wayland compositor
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B deniald
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B deniald
owns the DRM/KMS display, input devices, Wayland and Xwayland frontends, and
the embedded Flutter desktop scene.
An installed graphical session should normally start
.BR denial-session (1),
which discovers the correct devices, configuration, and Flutter bundle before
invoking this lower-level binary.
.SH SESSION OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-device " path"
Use the DRM card at
.IR path .
.TP
.BI \-\-render-device " path"
Render on a DRM node distinct from the KMS device. Both devices must support a
compatible DMA-BUF format and modifier.
.TP
.BI \-\-output-config " path"
Load persistent output configuration from
.IR path .
.TP
.B \-\-wayland
Start the Wayland frontend and Xwayland integration.
.TP
.BI \-\-flutter-bundle " path"
Load the packaged Flutter shell bundle from
.IR path .
.TP
.BI \-\-flutter-renderer " skia|impeller"
Select the Flutter GLES renderer. Impeller is the default.
.TP
.B \-\-start-locked
Initialize the native authentication gate and Flutter lock screen as locked.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show all runtime and diagnostic options.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Show the installed Denial version, immutable candidate build identity, and
Flutter Engine ABI generation.
.SH DIAGNOSTIC OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-frames " count"
Exit after a bounded number of presented frames.
.TP
.BI \-\-commit-seconds " seconds"
Exit after a bounded presentation interval.
.TP
.BI \-\-max-outputs " count"
Limit the outputs used by a controlled KMS run.
.TP
.BI \-\-output-position " name=x,y"
Override an output position for this invocation.
.PP
Additional reconfiguration and topology-test options are listed by
.BR "deniald --help" .
.SH SIGNALS
.TP
.B SIGUSR1
Refresh the embedded packaged Flutter runtime in process.
.TP
.B SIGUSR2
Re-evaluate the live KMS topology.
.TP
.B SIGINT, SIGTERM
Request a bounded compositor shutdown and KMS handoff.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/denial/session.conf
Administrator-owned session and device overrides read by
.BR denial-session (1).
.TP
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/denial/outputs.conf
Per-user output configuration initialized and passed by the session launcher.
.TP
.I /usr/lib/denial/flutter
Default installed Flutter shell bundle.
.TP
.I /usr/share/denial/version
Signed-tag runtime version installed only in release packages.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR denial-session (1),
.BR denialctl (1)
